"id": "d72a9d123efc4a12ac51ef7a6f85d0b2",
"title": "Offroad Jeep Game Simulator",
"iframe": "https://html5.gamedistribution.com/d72a9d123efc4a12ac51ef7a6f85d0b2/",
"description": "Navigate challenging offroad trails with a rugged jeep, mastering realistic vehicle physics to tackle rough terrain obstacles. The driving mechanic emphasizes terrain response and momentum control as players aim to complete courses without stalling or flipping. Progression relies on improving handling skills and adapting to diverse outdoor environments such as rocky paths and muddy slopes.\n\nKey Features\n\n• Terrain-sensitive jeep handling  \n• Momentum-based driving challenges  \n• Progressive difficulty with obstacle courses  \n• Time trial and free roam modes  \n• Natural offroad environment simulation"
